ved in suspected abuse, unauthorized activity, security threats, or violations of these Terms, subject to applicable law.\par \par \par \pard\sb200\sa100\keepn\cf1\b\fs26 5. User Data and Business Records\b0\cf0\fs20\par \par \pard\sa60 Users retain their ownership rights in business records, receipts, documents, images, attachments, and other information they submit to or create through BRED, subject to applicable third-party rights.\par \par \pard\sa60 Users are responsible for:\par \par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Ensuring that uploaded information is accurate.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Having the legal authority to store and process submitted documents.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Obtaining any necessary permissions from relevant individuals or organizations.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Maintaining independent copies of important business records.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Reviewing encoded receipts and financial information.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Ensuring that records comply with applicable accounting, tax, and business requirements.\par \par \pard\sa60 BRED is a documentation and management tool. It does not guarantee the accuracy, completeness, legal validity, or regulatory compliance of records entered by users.\par \par \pard\sa60 The developer does not independently verify the authenticity of every receipt, invoice, transaction, supplier record, or document submitted by users.\par \par \pard\sb120\sa60\keepn\b\fs22 5.1 Data Backups\b0\fs20\par \par \pard\sa60 Users are strongly encouraged to maintain independent backups of important business information.\par \par \pard\sa60 Although BRED may provide local storage, cloud storage, synchronization, or database functionality, no storage system can guarantee uninterrupted availability or permanent preservation of data.\par \par \pard\sa60 The developer does not guarantee that every record can always be recovered following:\par \par \pard\li