 devices, networks, or user permissions.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Unauthorized access caused by user or administrator actions.\par \par \pard\sb120\sa60\keepn\b\fs22 7.1 Limitation Regarding External Attacks\b0\fs20\par \par \pard\sa60 To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, the developer shall not be liable for unauthorized access, hacking attempts, malware infections, cyberattacks, data exposure, or service interruptions caused by independent third parties, compromised user devices, external infrastructure, or circumstances beyond the developer's reasonable control.\par \par \pard\sa60 This limitation does not exclude responsibilities that applicable law places on the developer, including obligations arising from its own unlawful conduct, fraud, actionable negligence, or data protection responsibilities.\par \par \pard\sb120\sa60\keepn\b\fs22 7.2 No Guarantee of Complete Security\b0\fs20\par \par \pard\sa60 The developer does not guarantee that BRED or any connected service will be immune from all forms of cyberattack, unauthorized access, exploitation, or security vulnerabilities.\par \par \pard\sa60 Security improvements may be introduced through patches, maintenance releases, configuration changes, and application updates.\par \par \pard\sa60 Users are encouraged to:\par \par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Install security updates.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Use strong and unique passwords.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Secure their Windows devices.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Use reputable endpoint protection.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Restrict access to authorized users.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Avoid sharing authentication credentials.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Maintain independent backups.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Use appropriate network security measures.\par \par \pard\sb120\sa60\keepn\b\fs22 7.3 Security Incident Reporting\b0\fs20\par \par \pard\sa60 Users who discover a suspected vulnerability or security incident affecting BRED should report it through:\par \par \pard\sa60 \bSecurity Contact:\b0 clarkhilario.bread@gmail.com\par \par \pard\sa60 Users must not exploit vulnerabilities, access another person's information, or interfere with BRED services.\par \par \pard\sa60 Nothing in this section removes any legal notification or reporting obligation that applies to the developer.\par \par \par \pard\sb200\sa100\keepn\cf1\b\fs26 8. Third-Party Services and External Dependencies\b0\cf0\fs20\par \par \pard\sa60 BRED may rely on third-party services and technologies, including:\par \par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Supabase.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Cloud database infrastructure.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Authentication providers.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab AI service providers.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Internet connectivity providers.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Cloud storage services.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Document processing services.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Operating system components.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Embedded browser technologies.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Other external libraries and software dependencies.\par \par \pard\sa60 These services may have their own terms, privacy policies, service limitations, and security practices.\par \par \pard\sa60 The developer does not own or control independent third-party infrastructure.\par \par \pard\sa60 To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, the developer is not responsible for independent third-party service interruptions, policy changes, security incidents, data loss, or failures outside the developer's reasonable control.\par \par \pard\sa60 The developer does not guarantee the continued availability, compatibility, pricing, or functionality of any third-party service.\par \par \pard\sa60 Where applicable, users must comply with the relevant third-party terms and conditions.\par \par \par \pard\sb200\sa100\keepn\cf1\b\fs26 9. Ducky AI \u8211? Artificial Intelligence Disclaimer\b0\cf0\fs20\par \par \pard\sa60 BRED includes Ducky AI, an integrated assistant designed to assist users with questions, business information, document interpretation, summarization, and other supported tasks.\par \par \pard\sa60 Ducky AI uses artificial intelligence technology and may produce information that is incomplete, inaccurate, outdated, misleading, or unsuitable for a particular business situation.\par \par \pard\sa60 AI-generated responses are provided for informational and assistance purposes only.\par \par \pard\sb120\sa60\keepn\b\fs22 9.1 No Guarantee of AI Accuracy\b0\fs20\par \par \pard\sa60 The developer does not guarantee that Ducky AI will:\par \par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Always provide correct answers.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Interpret every document accurately.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Correctly extract every receipt or financial value.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Produce legally compliant documents.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Provide professional accounting or tax advice.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Provide certified engineering calculations.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Produce accurate construction estimates.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Identify every error in uploaded documents.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Always follow every instruction correctly.\par \par \pard\sa60 AI-generated information must be independently reviewed before it is used in business operations or official records.\par \par \pard\sb120\sa60\keepn\b\fs22 9.2 Professional Advice\b0\fs20\par \par \pard\sa60 Ducky AI is not a substitute for qualified professionals.\par \par \pard\sa60 It does not replace the services of:\par \par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa60\u8226?\tab Accountants.\par \pard\li360\fi-360\sa6